catboostr licence and copyright provenance
===========================================

This file enumerates every third-party source that is compiled into (or
used to build) libcatboostr.so, and states its licence. It covers LICENCES
ONLY. Version pins, SHA256 checksums, acquisition mechanism and CVE-tracking
obligations are covered by ../SOURCES.md and are not restated here.

