  Licence:    Apache License, Version 2.0
  Source:     https://github.com/catboost/catboost
  Notes:      vendor/catboost/LICENSE, verbatim first line:
              "Copyright 2017-2026 YANDEX LLC" / "Apache License Version 2.0".
              This is the primary upstream project this package wraps;
              matches this package's own DESCRIPTION License field.
              CatBoost's own contrib/ tree bundles further third-party C++
              libraries (protobuf, flatbuffers, cxxsupp, etc.) under
              vendor/catboost/contrib/, each carrying its own upstream
              licence file inside that read-only pinned snapshot; those are
              upstream CatBoost's own vendoring decisions, not this fork's,
