Summary of what is actually EMBEDDED in the shipped libcatboostr.so
---------------------------------------------------------------------
  - CatBoost C++ core and its own contrib/ (Apache-2.0 and upstream's own
    per-component licences under vendor/catboost/contrib/).
  - OpenSSL 3.5.7, statically linked (Apache-2.0).
Ragel and Yasm are build-time-only tools; neither their binaries nor any
GPL/BSD-licensed code they are built from is copied into the installed
package or into libcatboostr.so.
